  <h2>About the Hosts</h2>
  <p><strong><a href="https://joelgoodman.co">{{ podcast.author }}</a></strong> leads global growth strategy at Squiz. For nearly two decades he's worked inside and alongside higher ed — running university sites, founding Bravery Media, and building the Hospitable Design framework for websites that serve people and institutions at once.</p>
